WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Adi sir namaste.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Namaskar.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sir aapko shuru mein kya problem thi?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Sir main kam se kam aapse pehle jo do saal se milne aaya tha.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
To mujhe aisa lag raha tha, matlab mujhe bechaini rehti thi.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Aisa lagta rehta tha attack aane wala hai mujhe.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
To aap yahan aane se pehle kitni jagah dikha chuke the?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Main yahan aane se pehle kaafi jagah dikha chuka tha.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Jaise hi sir se mila, to mujhe das din mein hi aaram milne laga.

